# Absolute origin of the FastAPI backend, baked in at BUILD time.
#
# Leave it UNSET (or delete this file) to build the demo-only site: no backend
# calls, GPU steps announce themselves as offline, the sample set still
# assembles. That is the free, always-on deployment — see docs/deploy.md.
#
# Set it when a backend is actually reachable (your machine behind a Cloudflare
# tunnel, or a rented GPU box). No trailing slash.
# VITE_API_BASE=https://api.legoarch.charlesabichahine.com
